  "created": "2026-08-07T09:53:00.823Z",
  "description": "A modern, dependency-free, strongly-typed fake data generator for .NET, with deterministic seeding and first-class country providers. One entry point — Fake.Person, Fake.Internet, Fake.Company, Fake.Address, Fake.Commerce and Fake.Country — each exposing a single value (FullName), a collection (FullNames(100)) and a strongly-typed object (Generate(100) returning PersonModel, CompanyModel, AddressModel, InternetModel or CommerceProductModel). Fake.UseSeed(42) makes every generator reproducible from a xoshiro256** generator that is byte-identical across platforms and .NET versions, so a seeded test fixture cannot drift under you. Fake.Country.Bangladesh generates coherent Bengali names, 01X mobile numbers, national IDs, and division/district/upazila addresses that actually nest correctly. Datasets ship as embedded JSON parsed with Utf8JsonReader — no reflection, no dynamic, no unsafe, no regular expressions. Multi-targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. Trim- and Native AOT-safe, with zero transitive dependencies.",
